sentences.text:
The main contention of the learned counsel for appellant/injured is that the learned Tribunal erred in awarding inadequate compensation as against the reasonable amount of compensation;
erred in not considering future loss of earnings, medical expenses, amenities, enjoyment of life,
marriage prospects, mental shock and ought to have assessed the income of the appellant more than Rs.5,000/- per month and hence requested for enhancement of compensation.

